<title>USA: Hanover Direct names Larry Svoboda CFO.</title>
<headline>Hanover Direct names Larry Svoboda CFO.</headline>
<dateline>WEEHAWKEN, N.J. 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hanover Direct Inc said on Wednesday it has named Larry Svoboda as senior vice president and chief financial officer, effective September 25, 1996.</p>
<p>Svoboda was previously chief financial officer at Florsheim Shoe Co, Hanover said.</p>
<p>Wayne Garten resigned earlier this year as Hanover Direct's chief financial officer, the company said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk  212-859-1610</p>
